dance Paddle
// The middle pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the highs set how fast it spins and the
// highs turn it; drops in the middle reverse it.
// Inspired by paddel, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.mid  speed 0.864  settle 0.03
zoom follows music.mid_hit  amount 0.5  settle 68.5
spin follows music.high  from 11.5 to 80.2  smooth 2.5
turn on music.high changes  by 0.49
reverse on music.mid drops  by 0.41  on 132 off 132
